"""
class_pool_merge

Validate and merge RELION Class3D particle pools across multiple jobs using a
declarative TOML configuration.

Phase 2A foundation:
    - CLI argument parsing (--config, --project-dir, --outdir, --dry-run)
    - TOML configuration loading via standard-library tomllib
    - Compact class range and integer list parsing
    - Strict validation of pools, frozen-pool modes, and 1..K class partitions

Phase 2B validation:
    - Class/model consistency and measured particle counts
    - Explicit or unambiguous common particle identities, including composites
    - Previous-input identity conservation and disjoint active/frozen sources
    - Optics/metadata compatibility, cumulative provenance and atomic pool output

Developed and maintained by Long Chen.
"""

